  "remarks": "“Beget” LLC is a well-known Russian cloud and web hosting provider. Since 2014, “Beget” LLC has knowingly provided services, such as hosting and domain services, to Russian backed illegal authorities, militarised organisations and propagandist projects, in illegally annexed Crimea, Donetsk and Luhansk, as well as to a significant number of Russian defence companies, including some listed entities subject to Union restrictive measures, relevant for Russia’s efforts in continuing the war of aggression against Ukraine.",
